# Jasper

> Jasper is an enterprise-grade generative AI platform purpose-built for marketing teams. It enables companies to create high-performing content, maintain brand consistency, and drive marketing performance at scale — powered by AI tuned to their brand voice and strategy.

## Core Pages

- [Home](https://www.jasper.ai/): Overview of Jasper's AI capabilities for marketing teams.
- [Platform](https://www.jasper.ai/platform): End-to-end platform covering content creation, optimization, and collaboration.
- [Solutions](https://www.jasper.ai/solutions): How Jasper serves specific marketing roles and teams.
- [Resources](https://www.jasper.ai/resources): Webinars, guides, case studies, and learning content.
- [Pricing](https://www.jasper.ai/pricing): Plan options for businesses and enterprise teams.
- [Demo](https://www.jasper.ai/demo): Request a live demo of Jasper.

## Products & Features

- [GEO & AI Optimization](https://www.jasper.ai/geo): Measure how your brand performs across every major AI answer engine, identify content gaps, and ship brand-governed content that AI will actually cite.
- [Brand IQ](https://www.jasper.ai/brand-iq): Train Jasper on your brand's tone, style, and approved language for consistent messaging across all content.
- [Marketing IQ](https://www.jasper.ai/marketing-iq): Inject campaign performance data so Jasper generates content optimized for what actually works.
- [AI Agents](https://www.jasper.ai/agents): Specialized agents for SEO, blogging, ad copy, social media, and email — built for marketing workflows.
- [Canvas](https://www.jasper.ai/canvas): Visual editor for collaborative ideation, writing, and campaign planning.
- [Grid](https://www.jasper.ai/grid): Scale personalized content variations across audiences, channels, and formats.
- [Studio](https://www.jasper.ai/studio): Create and edit on-brand images and visual assets alongside your written content.

## Trust & Compliance

- [Trust Center](https://www.jasper.ai/trust): Security, privacy, and compliance commitments.
- [Security](https://www.jasper.ai/security): Infrastructure security and risk policies. Jasper is SOC 2 Type II certified and GDPR compliant.
- [Ethics](https://www.jasper.ai/ethics): Ethical AI use, governance, and transparency standards.

## Learning Resources

- [Blog](https://www.jasper.ai/blog): Expert articles on AI marketing strategy, content creation, SEO, and enterprise AI adoption.
- [Webinars](https://www.jasper.ai/webinars): On-demand and live sessions on AI transformation in marketing.
- [Free Tools](https://www.jasper.ai/tools): Free AI tools including bio generators, meta description writers, and more.
- [Use Cases](https://www.jasper.ai/use-cases): Examples of Jasper applied to content strategy, SEO, email, and campaign development.
- [GEO & AI Optimization](https://www.jasper.ai/geo): Tools and guidance for winning AI search — monitor citation rates, close content gaps, and generate governed content at scale.

## Case Studies

- [Bonterra](https://www.jasper.ai/case-studies/bonterra): Enterprise software company responded to 3 months of customer reviews in under 2 hours with Jasper, achieving 83% time savings.
- [iHeartMedia](https://www.jasper.ai/case-studies/iheartmedia): America's largest audio media company delivered the first AI-powered multi-platform campaign under its "Guaranteed Human" promise — in 1 day vs. weeks.
- [Savista](https://www.jasper.ai/case-studies/savista): Healthcare revenue cycle company used Jasper to scale content creation, amplify executive voice, and launch new campaigns in 3 weeks.
- [Trusted Media Brands](https://www.jasper.ai/case-studies/trusted-media-brands): Publishing enterprise achieved a 37.5% increase in RFP responses YoY by scaling content production and deepening advertiser connections with Jasper.
- [Old Dominion Freight Line](https://www.jasper.ai/case-studies/old-dominion-freight-line): One of the largest LTL carriers in the US scaled expert content creation, boosted SEO performance, and built customer trust with Jasper.
- [Webster First Federal Credit Union](https://www.jasper.ai/case-studies/webster-first-federal-credit-union): Credit union used Jasper to power 9x organic traffic growth and build a high-impact content marketing engine.
- [CloudBees](https://www.jasper.ai/case-studies/cloudbees): Enterprise software company used Jasper to accelerate content creation, maintain brand consistency, and scale marketing operations across global teams.
- [All Case Studies](https://www.jasper.ai/customer-stories): Full library of customer success stories.

## Featured Blog Articles

- [Introducing Jasper GEO Agent and GEO Hub: End-to-End AI Search Optimization](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/geo-agent-and-geo-hub) (June 2026): Jasper's end-to-end system for turning AI search visibility into consistent, compounding brand authority.
- [Google's Guide to AI Search: 5 Must-Know Takeaways for Marketers](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/googles-guide-to-ai-search) (June 2026): Actionable ways to win AI search based on guidance straight from Google.
- [Why Brand Consistency is So Important for AI Search Discovery](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/brand-consistency) (April 2026): How to stand out and be the answer in AI search through consistent, on-brand content.
- [Navigating the Shift from Prompting AI to Goal-Driven Agents](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/goal-driven-agents) (April 2026): As AI agents evolve marketing from task-based assistance to goal-oriented systems, embedding governance at every layer has become mission-critical.
- [What is Generative Engine Optimization? GEO vs AEO vs SEO Guide 2026](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/geo-aeo) (April 2026): How generative engine optimization (GEO) and answer engine optimization (AEO) help your content get cited by AI search engines like ChatGPT, Perplexity, and Google AI Overviews.
- [Digital Marketing's New Operating Model](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/ai-digital-marketing) (April 2026): Insights from leaders at Forrester, Samsara, and Blue Yonder on how AI is changing websites, channel strategy, brand building, and marketing operations.
- [The #1 Role You Should Hire in 2026 Is a Content Engineer](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/content-engineer-role) (April 2026): Content engineering builds the systems that become the foundation for influence in the AI era.
- [AI Maturity Is the Strongest Predictor of Impact in 2026](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/ai-maturity-2026) (February 2026): The most advanced marketing teams have cracked the code on AI scalability, governance, and ROI measurement.
- [New Research: The State of AI in Marketing 2026](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/state-of-ai-marketing-2026) (January 2026): Trends from 1,400 marketers defining the operational era of AI.
- [Forrester TEI Study Finds Measurable ROI and Business Impact with Jasper](https://www.jasper.ai/blog/forrester-tei-study-roi) (September 2025): The Forrester Total Economic Impact study reveals 342% ROI and $2.2M in annual time savings for Jasper customers.

