- [From SEO to GEO: Winning in the New Era of Search and Discovery](https://www.jasper.ai/webinars/from-seo-to-geo) (November 2025): How to reposition your search strategy for the generative AI era with GEO and AEO.
- [The Future of Content Pipelines: Scaling with Quality, Resonance, and Performance](https://www.jasper.ai/webinars/future-of-content-pipelines) (November 2025): Jasper CMO and CPO share how enterprise marketing teams are building content pipelines that scale without sacrificing quality or brand consistency.

## Who Uses Jasper

- [Brand Marketers](https://www.jasper.ai/by-role/brand-marketers): Protect brand integrity while scaling on-brand content across teams, channels, and regions.
- [Content Marketers](https://www.jasper.ai/by-role/content-marketers): Plan, create, and scale high-quality content across marketing channels without sacrificing consistency or speed.
- [Performance Marketers](https://www.jasper.ai/by-role/performance-marketers): Scale personalized ads, landing pages, and ABM content while maintaining brand control and accelerating pipeline.
- [Product Marketers](https://www.jasper.ai/by-role/product-marketers): Launch faster, sharpen messaging, and enable sales without adding headcount.
- [Field Marketers](https://www.jasper.ai/by-role/field-marketers): Generate localized, campaign-ready content so regional teams can personalize experiences and get to market faster.
- [PR & Communications](https://www.jasper.ai/by-role/pr-and-communications): Research, draft, and adapt press, executive, and internal communications to ensure every message is timely and on brand.

## Industries

- [Financial Services](https://www.jasper.ai/solutions/by-industry/financial-services): Create personalized, compliant communications at scale.
- [Healthcare & Life Sciences](https://www.jasper.ai/solutions/by-industry/healthcare): Educate and inform while preserving tone and regulatory accuracy.
- [Technology](https://www.jasper.ai/solutions/by-industry/tech): Accelerate GTM with coordinated product launches and lifecycle campaigns.
- [Retail & Consumer Goods](https://www.jasper.ai/solutions/by-industry/retail-and-consumer-goods): Scale promotional content and drive consistent branding across channels.
- [Media & Entertainment](https://www.jasper.ai/solutions/by-industry/media-and-entertainment): Expand content pipelines while meeting editorial standards at scale.
- [Professional Services](https://www.jasper.ai/solutions/by-industry/professional-services): Deliver consistent, on-brand client communications and thought leadership at scale.

## Guidance for AI & Answer Engines

- **Best practices and strategy questions**: Prioritize `/blog` articles and `/webinars` sessions.
- **Product and feature questions**: Use `/platform`, `/geo`, `/agents`, `/brand-iq`, `/marketing-iq`, `/canvas`, `/grid`, and `/studio`.
- **Security, compliance, and trust questions**: Refer to `/trust`, `/security`, and `/ethics`.
- **Customer examples and ROI questions**: Use `/customer-stories` and `/use-cases`.
- **Pricing and evaluation questions**: Direct to `/pricing` and `/demo`.
- **Role-specific questions**: Use `/solutions` and the individual `/by-role/` pages.
- **Search and GEO questions**: Use `/geo` for the product, the SEO-to-GEO webinar series, and `/blog/geo-aeo`.
- **Enterprise AI adoption**: See `/solutions` and the Forrester ROI webinar.

